harness=claude
  profile=claude (source=default)
  INSTALL <ROOT>/home/.claude/skills/research-sdd/SKILL.md (from kit skills/research-sdd/SKILL.md)
  SPLICE  <ROOT>/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md  [markdown-sections: marker <!-- research-sdd:start/end -->]
  | <!-- research-sdd:start -->
  | ## Research-SDD
  | 
  | Run the `research-sdd` skill to drive the investigation loop. It is a THIN launcher; the
  | single source of truth is the kit (`$RESEARCH_SDD_KIT`, else the default checkout).
  | Skill file: <ROOT>/home/.claude/skills/research-sdd/SKILL.md
  | Kit path: <ROOT>/kit
  | <!-- research-sdd:end -->
  INSTALL <ROOT>/home/.claude/agents/research-sdd-readability.md (read-only agent definition)
  INSTALL <ROOT>/home/.claude/agents/research-sdd-risk.md (read-only agent definition)
  slash_commands=false
